{
 "case": "TUI-ENTRY-ACCOUNT-FREE",
 "says": "A first user with no Team, no account, no provider connection and no repository creates a local principal from a device key on this laptop (identity.binding.add, established by local creation, no evidence from any provider), and the host is probed for reading what a start hands it. The launcher offers one qualified personal start route. The entry (surface.drive) shows the three personal positions checked and empty, the tool as a suggestion marked '(제안)', and one start action; there is no goal or task field. Tab and Enter dispatch one preparation.compose request whose basis is the personal scope alone with no source pins and no work_request; the owner commits a preparation of nothing selected whose task support is not requested, observed at a plain local folder, and route.select answers for that request with it. Negative: no step signs in, founds or selects a Team, binds a repository or reaches a provider; no answer carries a gap or recovery that asks for sign-in, a Team or a repository; and the missing intent is neither an error nor a guessed work_request.",
